{"segs": ["PA_ja_234:0.1"], "en": "Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_234:0.2", "PA_ja_234:0.3"], "en": "The Book of the Twos (Dukanipāta), Chapter on Sandals (Upāhanavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_234:0.4"], "en": "4. The Asitābhū Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_234:1.1", "PA_ja_234:1.2"], "en": "“O Makara, now that desire has departed from you, it is you alone who [must suffer].”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_234:1.3"], "en": "Thus he is without rebirth-linking,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_234:1.4"], "en": "like fine dust blown away by the wind. Through excessive greed for what is not his own,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_234:2.1"], "en": "he has been utterly destroyed.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_234:2.2"], "en": "And through the intoxication of excessive greed;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_234:2.3"], "en": "thus one falls away from one's welfare,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_234:2.4"], "en": "like me by my insatiable belly.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_234:3.1"], "en": "The Asitābhūjātaka is the fourth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
